      <summary class="mcp-h">How this town is built</summary>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Single source of truth.</strong> Everything here is compiled from schema-validated portfolio and curriculum vitae specifications. Pushing to it rebuilds the site, the twin and LeBronette.</li>
        <li><strong>Static first.</strong> Astro renders every page to pure HTML at build time. JavaScript only loads for the town, the live radar and interactive mission briefs.</li>
        <li><strong>A tiny engine, no game framework.</strong> Grid movement, collision and tap-to-move in a few hundred lines of TypeScript. The render loop sleeps when you stand still.</li>
        <li><strong>Tactical Edge AI &amp; Cloud.</strong> Powered by real-world high-performance models (TensorRT 10, YOLOv11s, Laravel 12, Apache Kafka, and Kubernetes).</li>
